{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.decodeText\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">decodeText</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">text</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decodes the backslash escapes and character references in `s`. CommonMark applies this decoding to\nlink destinations, link titles, and the info strings of fenced code blocks.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.decodeText","kind":"def","line":105,"name":"Lean.Markdown.decodeText","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.lean#L105-L139"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.decodeCharacterReference?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">decodeCharacterReference?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> (<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a character reference whose `&` is immediately before `i`. On success, returns the decoded\ntext together with the position after the `;`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.decodeCharacterReference?","kind":"def","line":85,"name":"Lean.Markdown.decodeCharacterReference?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.lean#L85-L103"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.isCharacterReferenceChar\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">isCharacterReferenceChar</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether `c` can occur in the body of a character reference. The body consists of ASCII letters,\ndigits, and `#`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.isCharacterReferenceChar","kind":"def","line":68,"name":"Lean.Markdown.isCharacterReferenceChar","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.lean#L68-L73"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.characterReference?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">characterReference?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">body</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decodes the body of a character reference `&body;` (CommonMark §2.5), which is the text between `&`\nand `;`.\n\nNamed references are those of HTML. Decimal references (`#` followed by one to seven digits) and\nhexadecimal references (`#x` or `#X` followed by one to six hex digits) denote a code point; the\ncode point zero, surrogates, and values above U+10FFFF decode to U+FFFD.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.characterReference?","kind":"def","line":45,"name":"Lean.Markdown.characterReference?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.lean#L45-L66"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.isAsciiPunctuation\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">isAsciiPunctuation</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether `c` is in CommonMark's ASCII-punctuation set, which is\n``!\"#$%&'()*+,-./:;<=>?@[\\]^_\\`{|}~``. These are the only characters that a backslash escape\nconsumes; a backslash before any other character is a literal backslash followed by the character.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.isAsciiPunctuation","kind":"def","line":33,"name":"Lean.Markdown.isAsciiPunctuation","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.lean#L33-L43"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.isAsciiControl\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">isAsciiControl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether `c` is an ASCII control character (CommonMark §2.1), which is U+0000 to U+001F, or U+007F.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.html#Lean.Markdown.isAsciiControl","kind":"def","line":27,"name":"Lean.Markdown.isAsciiControl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Text.lean#L27-L31"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.String.Basic","Init.Data.String.Length","Init.Data.String.Slice.Basic","Init.Data.String.Subslice","Init.Prelude","Init.While","Lean.Data.Html.CharRef"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Data.Markdown.Text"}